#
# lintian 2.117 (Ubuntu 24.04) takes a JavaScript or HTML file with a line of
# 512 characters or more for minified code whose source is missing. These five
# are written by hand and are their own source; their long lines are a test's
# expected text (the Control Deck's and the portal's script tests), a table of
# page titles (the Control Deck), an inline SVG icon (the portal's page) and the
# list of interface languages with their names (the portal's script). Debian
# 13's lintian does not report them (hmailserver/docs/SourcePackages.md).
source-is-missing [build/deck-script-test.js]
source-is-missing [build/portal-script-test.js]
source-is-missing [hmailserver/installation/WebAdmin/index.html]
source-is-missing [hmailserver/source/Server/Common/Util/Portal.html]
source-is-missing [hmailserver/source/Server/Common/Util/Portal.js]
